This problem can be solved using the Bron-Kerbosch algorithm, which is a well-known algorithm for finding all maximal cliques in an undirected graph. In this case, we want to find all triangles in the graph, which corresponds to finding all maximal cliques of size 3. Since we are only allowed to ask 11, 111 queries, we need to be very efficient with our queries.

Here is the Python program that solves the problem:

